      "raw": "[quote=\"Silverleaf\"]\nIf you use Haka to kill something that only has HP because of Imbued Vitality, does that work?\n[/quote]\n<br /><br />Imbued Viatality has always confused me to an extent- do cards with HP that don&#39;t normally have it lose their HP when Imbued Vitality goes away? If so, are they destroyed because they had HP and it&#39;s now dropped to zero?\n",
