      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>When Imbued Vitality leaves play it doesn&#39;t drop HP to zero, it&#39;s just like a character card without a printed value (i.e. the incap sides of Hero cards or Miss Information), they don&#39;t have 0 HP they have no HP, they are not a target and are not destroyed because only targets with 0 (or less) HP are subject to destruction due to that.</p>",
