      "created_at": "2015-03-24T21:03:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a game once where we had Imbued Vitality and +1 damage.  The Haka player had Savage Mana out.  We had an assortment of equipment out and there were some villain targets as well.  He played Rampage.  Then, he unleashed Savage Mana.  I laughed.  The villain was essentially finished.</p>",
